==English==

===Alternative forms===
* {{alt|en|dumb blond}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# {{lb|en|pejorative}} A common stereotype of a blonde as a woman with low intelligence.
#: ''Have you found the canonical list of '''dumb blonde''' jokes on the Internet yet?''
#* {{quote-text|en|year=1988|author=w:Thomas Dolby|title=Airhead
|passage=My friends say she's a '''dumb blonde''' but they don't know she dyes her hair.}}
# {{lb|en|by extension|rare}} A man of similar type.

====Usage notes====
Humor or otherwise, using the term to refer to a male will usually cause confusion.

